"⟪k:0⟫Tell me, how was it?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Living in so many different eras, not knowing who you were..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dimmi, com’è stato?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vivere in così tante epoche diverse, senza sapere chi tu "
